      <ActivityOrMissionDesc>THE STEPS FOUNDATION EMPOWERS THE WOMEN OF SPECIAL OPERATIONS FORCES THROUGH HOLISTIC, TRAUMA-INFORMED CARE, SPOUSES AND FEMALE OPERATORS THROUGH PERSONALIZED WELLNESS PROGRAMMING THAT ADDRESSES MENTAL HEALTH, PHYSICAL HEALTH, CAREER DEVELOPMENT, AND COMMUNITY CONNECTION. OUR MOST SIGNIFICANT ACTIVITY IS THE DELIVERY OF CUSTOMIZED, SIX-MONTH COHORTS AND IN-PERSON IMMERSIVE RETREATS THAT EQUIP PARTICIPANTS WITH TOOLS FOR HEALING, GROWTH, AND LONG-TERM RESILIENCE DURING AND AFTER MILITARY TRANSITION.</ActivityOrMissionDesc>
