      <MissionDesc>THE STEPS FOUNDATION PROVIDES FEMALE VETERANS, GOLD STAR SPOUSES, AND SOF SPOUSES WITH CURATED, TRAUMA-INFORMED RESOURCES AND SERVICES THAT FOSTER WELLNESS, CAREER TRANSITION, AND COMMUNITY CONNECTION DURING THEIR TRANSITION AWAY FROM MILITARY LIFE.</MissionDesc>
      <SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>1</SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>
      <SignificantChangeInd>0</SignificantChangeInd>
      <ExpenseAmt>195967</ExpenseAmt>
      <Desc>PHYSICAL HEALTH AND WELLNESS: NUTRITION AND FITNESS PROGRAMS MAKE HEALTHY LIVING APPROACHABLE. FAMILIES RECEIVE INDIVIDUALIZED SUPPORT TO SIMPLIFY MEALTIMES, PROVIDE MENUS FOR SPECIFIC HEALTH CONCERNS, REACH PERSONAL FITNESS GOALS, AND DISCOVER TOOLS TO HELP RECONNECT FAMILIES WITH THEIR OPERATOR AFTER SO MANY YEARS APART. ENDOCRINE BALANCING HELPS IDENTIFY IMBALANCES IN HORMONE LEVELS AND SPIKES IN CORTISOL LEVELS, PROVIDING SUPPLEMENTS FOR CONTINUED HEALTH AND WELLNESS AND OFFERING HOLISTIC HEALTH PROGRAMS TO REDUCE STRESS AND ANXIETY. THE FOUNDATION OFFERS VIRTUAL PELVIC FLOOR THERAPY TO HELP ADDRESS PELVIC ISSUES</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>189900</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>MENTAL HEALTH AND WELLNESS PROGRAM: THE FOUNDATION OFFERS MEDITATION AND MINDFULNESS SESSIONS, INTRODUCING TOOLS TO HELP REDUCE STRESS BY SHIFTING THE NERVOUS SYSTEM FROM THE SYMPATHETIC TO THE PARASYMPATHETIC. SOMATIC COACHING INCLUDES LEADING EDGE TRAUMA-INFORMED SOMATIC THERAPISTS WHO WORK WITH SPOUSES TO ADDRESS PAST TRAUMAS AND NERVOUS SYSTEM DYSREGULATION, ENABLING SPOUSES TO CLAIM A SENSE OF SAFETY, VITALITY AND EMBODIMENT BEYOND LONG HELD SURVIVAL PATTERNS.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>55673</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>CAREER AND EDUCATION: PERFORMANCE-BASED COACHING SESSIONS, UTILIZING NEUROSCIENCE, POSITIVE PSYCHOLOGY AND STRENGTH-BASED TOOLS AND TECHNIQUES TO HELP SPOUSES GAIN CLARITY ON PURPOSE, PASSION AND STRENGTHS. FINANCIAL READINESS EDUCATION SESSIONS AND ONE-ON-ONE FINANCIAL COUNSELING HELP SPOUSES CREATE AND IMPLEMENT A CUSTOMIZED FINANCIAL PLAN. FOR SPOUSES WHO HAVE RECENTLY RELOCATED OR ARE SEEKING A CAREER CHANGE, WE PROVIDE TAILORED SUPPORT THROUGH RESUME WRITING SERVICES AND LINKEDIN ADVISORY SESSIONS, HELPING THEM HIGHLIGHT THEIR UNIQUE SKILLS AND EXPERIENCES.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActyOtherGrp>
        <ExpenseAmt>34334</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>COMMUNITY: THE FOUNDATION HOSTS MONTHLY CONNECTION CALLS, OFFERING DIVERSE SESSIONS LED BY CAREFULLY CURATED PROVIDERS. ROOTED IN OUR FOUR CORNERSTONES MENTAL, PHYSICAL, COMMUNITY, AND CAREER AND EDUCATION THESE CALLS CREATE A TRUSTED SPACE FOR LEARNING, CONNECTION, AND GROWTH. SPIRITUAL CONNECTION GROUPS ARE DESIGNED TO FOSTER WISDOM, PERSONAL GROWTH, AND A DEEPER SENSE OF PURPOSE, WHILE BENEFITING FROM THE FELLOWSHIP OF LIKE-MINDED SPOUSES WHO UNDERSTAND THE UNIQUE CHALLENGES AND JOYS OF MILITARY LIFE. THESE GROUPS OFFER A SUPPORTIVE ENVIRONMENT TO SHARE, CONNECT, AND GROW TOGETHER AS A SISTERHOOD BEYOND THE MILITARY. THE FOUNDATION HOSTS MONTHLY CONNECTION CALLS, OFFERING DIVERSE SESSIONS LED BY CAREFULLY CURATED PROVIDERS. ROOTED IN OUR FOUR CORNERSTONES MENTAL, PHYSICAL, COMMUNITY, AND CAREER AND EDUCATION THESE CALLS CREATE A TRUSTED SPACE FOR LEARNING, CONNECTION, AND GROWTH. SPIRITUAL CONNECTION GROUPS ARE DESIGNED TO FOSTER WISDOM, PERSONAL GROWTH, AND A DEEPER SENSE OF PURPOSE, WHILE BENEFITING FROM THE FELLOWSHIP OF LIKE-MINDED SPOUSES WHO UNDERSTAND THE UNIQUE CHALLENGES AND JOYS OF MILITARY LIFE. THESE GROUPS OFFER A SUPPORTIVE ENVIRONMENT TO SHARE, CONNECT, AND GROW TOGETHER AS A SISTERHOOD BEYOND THE MILITARY.</Desc>
